brief.prompt:
Rewrite the entries from v3.0.0 to v3.8.2 in CHANGELOG.md according to docs/changelog-style.md. Rules:
1. Change each version heading to `## [3.x.y] - YYYY-MM-DD`, using the date of the matching git tag (`git log -1 --format=%as v3.x.y`);
2. Group entries under Added / Changed / Fixed / Removed: `feat:` → Added, `fix:` → Fixed, `refactor:` and `perf:` → Changed, `remove:` → Removed; delete `chore:` and `ci:` entries outright;
3. Write every PR number as `(#123)` at the end of the line;
4. Don't change a single word of the original entry text;
5. Don't touch v2.x or anything earlier.
When you're done, run `npx markdownlint-cli2 CHANGELOG.md` and fix whatever it reports until it passes.

Rename the config key `apiBaseUrl` to `apiBaseURL` everywhere. Scope (I've already grepped it — 23 files in total):
1. the field name in the zod schema in src/config/schema.ts;
2. src/config/defaults.ts and src/config/load.ts;
3. every read of `config.apiBaseUrl` under apps/web, apps/admin and apps/mobile (17 places);
4. the comment in .env.example;
5. the tables in docs/configuration.md and docs/zh/configuration.md.
The environment variable name `API_BASE_URL` stays the same. Don't change any logic — only the name. When you're done, run `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm test config`; if both pass, you're finished. If anything fails, paste the error and don't guess at a fix.
